00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:51.020
- So let's start with the basics.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:54.420
What is procurement and supply
chain management consulting

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.720
all about?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:59.990
- Usually we divide it into
direct and indirect articles.

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:02.740
So direct articles is
everything that flows

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:06.060
into the production of the article itself

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.240
that the client producers.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.730
So for example, if you have a clothing,

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.470
so it would be everything
that is used to produce

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:18.270
this clothing, like the buttons,
like the fabric and so on.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.530
Indirect on the other hand is everything

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.200
that is indirectly used
to produce this article,

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.330
which can be energy or all the utilities,

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:31.010
or it can also be logistics
or something like that.

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:33.140
- So let's look at the
different types of projects

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.080
that you would do as a
procurement consultant.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.750
So what are the different variations

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.560
that you actually do in your job?

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.670
- Sure, I prepared here
as small flip chart.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.730
So let me start with
the most common project,

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:47.900
which is reducing costs.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:52.890
So clients often come to
us and they want to reduce

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.270
their costs to have a higher margin

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.290
or simply to be more
competitive at the market.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.723
So this is for sure, one of
our most common projects.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:08.590
Then we also have clients that come to us

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.380
because they want to change something

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.250
in their procurement organization.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.680
This often happens after
a merger and acquisitions

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.583
or also for clients that want
to do an IPO, for example.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:26.150
We have clients that not
only want to change something

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:27.420
in their procurement,

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:30.100
but they want to change the
whole end-to-end structure.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.330
So they want to have a closer
look at their supply chain

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:37.120
to improve their efficiency and maybe also

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.773
to improve their lead times.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.140
Then in previous years, digital became

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:47.350
more and more important
also for our clients

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.910
also in procurement.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.530
This is why Inverto founded

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.360
our own digital data science department,

00:05:55.360 --> 00:06:00.073
where they come in into our
projects if they are needed.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.120
For a lot of our clients, design
to value is also important.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:08.470
So changing the product
to maximize their impact

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.490
on the customer.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:13.683
So really customer-focused product design.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:19.460
And last but not least,
we have the new clients.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:23.346
For example, sustainability
became very important

00:06:23.346 --> 00:06:26.060
in the past few years
for all of our clients.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:29.023
So this is also topics
that we are focusing on.

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.380
- So now that we learned
what procurement consulting

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:35.400
