00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.240
How was this experience for you?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.650
And can you maybe share a couple of tips

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.690
for the people also in the audience,

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:01.610
