becoming a project lead soon,

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:03.663
what did you do to become successful?

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:07.790
- So I think at first,

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:11.320
so, when I had my first project,
the first thing I noticed

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.260
that all the responsibility
suddenly is on you.

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.430
So the consultants come to you,

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.410
senior consultants, they want
to know what they should do,

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.500
but also all the others come to you.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.970
So MDs, partners, principals,

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.860
because they want of course
to get all the knowledge

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.410
they need for the client.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:32.200
So suddenly all the attention is on you

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.660
and all the other responsibility.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:37.340
And that's something
you need to get used to,

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.720
but at some point you really like it.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.670
So at least it was for me.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.480
- Yeah, I think it's super important

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:46.450
to have a good structure in
regards to how you take notes,

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.800
how you organize yourself in
regards to emails and calls

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.610
and how you also structure the team

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.860
in regards to communication with you.

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:57.640
So, as Daniella said, you have
to answer all the questions

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.410
from client side, from team side,

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:02.490
from managing level in your firm.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.810
And that's where you need
a really good structure

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:08.350
to have all the knowledge
condensed and ready on the spot

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.898
when you need it.

00:11:09.898 --> 00:11:11.040
- It makes a lot of sense,
